  "description": "Kim Ha-Shin, a low-ranking guardian god, is determined to make his town the happiest there is and get promoted to a higher rank. But his plan goes awry when Nam Da-Reum, a girl with an extremely low happiness level and no will to live, moves to town. Now Hashin must do everything in his power to make Da-Reum happy so that he can save her and everything he's worked for. As hardships and obstacles continue to mount, will Ha-Shin manage to help Da-Reum find true joy in life and put his town back on top?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
